    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cystoscopy and urinary tract imaging"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " if there = ⍉response to abx, Sx recur, or there = hematuria w.o infect."
     }
